TT  - SHAP-based Analysis of Meteorological Elements and Air Pollutant Data for Predictive Performance Improvement
T2  - 한국항행학회논문지
KW  - Explainable AI
KW  - SHAP
KW  - Deep learning
KW  - Particulate matter
